 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "SearchHistory(capacity) starts empty with capacity >= 1. add(term) makes term the most recent entry (moving it when already present); if more than capacity distinct terms are then stored, the least recent is removed. getTopK(k) returns the min(k, stored) most recent terms, most recent first; it does not change recency. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
